  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ReadableNote
  text: 'BACKUP GENERATOR - CANAL ST

    Tank: EMPTY. Two cans left: one in the cab of the train parked in the north-east tunnel, one in the stores cage on the lower level (maintenance door, south tunnel).

    Spark plug: shot. Spare is in the station master''s office.

    Office key is on the ticket booth''s back counter.

    NB: backup power also releases the emergency latch on the lower level.

    - Line 4 Maintenance'
